{"text": "Every afternoon, the children played in the Giant's beautiful garden. One day, the Giant came home. 'My garden is my garden!' he shouted, and the children ran away. He built a high wall around it, and winter stayed in his garden all year. One morning, the children climbed in through a hole in the wall, and spring came back! The Giant smiled and gently lifted a little boy into a tree, which burst into flowers. Then he knocked down the wall. 'It is your garden now, little children,' he said.", "words": [[0.5, 0.72], [0.82, 1.42], [1.64, 1.72], [1.8, 2.2], [2.28, 2.64], [2.68, 2.74], [2.76, 2.82], [2.9, 3.36], [3.5, 3.96], [4.04, 4.5], [6.16, 6.28], [6.32, 6.52], [6.62, 6.7], [6.78, 7.14], [7.18, 7.4], [7.5, 7.78], [7.86, 8.28], [8.36, 8.74], [8.82, 8.9], [8.96, 9.12], [9.24, 9.76], [10.02, 10.06], [10.2, 10.66], [10.74, 10.8], [10.82, 10.9], [10.96, 11.38], [11.48, 11.64], [11.68, 12.04], [13.62, 13.68], [13.76, 13.98], [14.04, 14.06], [14.2, 14.46], [14.54, 14.78], [14.82, 15.18], [15.24, 15.34], [15.54, 15.64], [15.7, 16.06], [16.18, 16.52], [16.54, 16.6], [16.62, 16.72], [16.8, 17.16], [17.36, 17.52], [17.62, 17.88], [19.52, 19.64], [19.68, 20.0], [20.06, 20.12], [20.2, 20.58], [20.66, 20.96], [20.98, 21.08], [21.16, 21.38], [21.4, 21.42], [21.56, 21.84], [21.88, 21.94], [21.98, 22.06], [22.12, 22.44], [22.82, 22.94], [23.04, 23.38], [23.46, 23.7], [23.76, 24.12], [25.66, 25.74], [25.8, 26.18], [26.3, 26.82], [26.9, 27.0], [27.06, 27.4], [27.48, 27.76], [27.8, 27.82], [27.88, 28.1], [28.16, 28.4], [28.54, 28.7], [28.76, 28.78], [28.9, 29.2], [29.52, 29.68], [29.82, 30.2], [30.26, 30.44], [30.54, 31.14], [32.68, 32.84], [32.88, 32.94], [33.04, 33.32], [33.4, 33.58], [33.62, 33.7], [33.76, 34.1], [34.16, 34.66], [34.72, 34.82], [34.88, 35.04], [35.14, 35.52], [35.6, 35.76], [35.84, 36.08], [36.16, 36.74], [36.78, 36.84], [36.98, 38.4]], "scenes": [0.0, 5.61, 13.14, 18.96, 25.19, 32.21], "tag": "kokoro:bf_alice", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1"}